EPISODE 50:
A STUBBORN FIGHT

69
00:02:46,930 --> 00:02:49,770
Yellow card!

70
00:02:49,770 --> 00:02:53,520
A warning for both Hyuga-kun and Takasugi-kun, who were playing physically!

71
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:55,200
Yellow card...

72
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:57,280
One more means ejection from the game.

73
00:02:57,280 --> 00:03:01,280
I understand your excitement, but this is a football match.

74
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:04,480
You two must avoid this kind of behavior.

75
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:05,490
Okay.

76
00:03:05,490 --> 00:03:06,680
Sorry.

77
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:08,970
I'm sorry about that.

78
00:03:08,970 --> 00:03:10,460
A-Ah.

79
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:16,470
It's not your fault that we're tied.

80
00:03:16,470 --> 00:03:20,300
If anyone has to take responsibility, we're all to blame.

81
00:03:20,300 --> 00:03:22,900
You don't need to feel responsible, Hyuga-san.

82
00:03:22,900 --> 00:03:24,350
We're all a team here.

83
00:03:24,770 --> 00:03:26,010
Takeshi.

84
00:03:26,010 --> 00:03:28,590
But still, you gave in to your emotions,

85
00:03:28,590 --> 00:03:31,180
and attacked Nankatsu alone...

86
00:03:31,180 --> 00:03:34,960
Seeing that you still have that side of you made us happy, Hyuga-san.

87
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:37,680
Everyone...

88
00:03:38,310 --> 00:03:39,540
It's a bad habit of mine.

89
00:03:39,540 --> 00:03:40,950
I flare up too easily.

90
00:03:42,020 --> 00:03:45,690
Right. With Toho Academy's combined strength,

91
00:03:45,690 --> 00:03:49,350
let's score our fourth goal and regain the lead!

92
00:03:49,350 --> 00:03:50,210
Okay!

93
00:03:53,160 --> 00:03:54,460
I'm so happy.

94
00:03:54,460 --> 00:03:57,400
To have been able to play football with them all this time...

95
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:59,920
I'm truly happy!

96
00:04:00,470 --> 00:04:04,930
It seems Hyuga-kun will take the free kick and continue play.

97
00:04:04,930 --> 00:04:07,640
Will he attempt a direct goal?

98
00:04:07,640 --> 00:04:10,070
Listen! Don't even think about dodging this!

99
00:04:10,070 --> 00:04:11,020
We know.

100
00:04:14,550 --> 00:04:16,450
Not a shot!

101
00:04:16,450 --> 00:04:18,900
A pass to Toho's key scorer, Sorimachi-kun!

102
00:04:23,110 --> 00:04:23,860
Damn it!

103
00:04:24,370 --> 00:04:25,530
Nice, Tsubasa!

104
00:04:25,530 --> 00:04:26,700
Morisaki!

105
00:04:27,660 --> 00:04:29,830
Alright! For Tsubasa's sake, let's attack!

106
00:04:30,910 --> 00:04:34,170
If Wakashimazu's left arm is truly injured,

107
00:04:34,170 --> 00:04:36,540
then the right corner of the goal is his weakness!

108
00:04:36,540 --> 00:04:38,960
Let me test you once more!

109
00:04:39,960 --> 00:04:40,760
Damn it!

110
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:44,530
He went to the right side and it went out.

111
00:04:44,530 --> 00:04:46,030
No doubt.

112
00:04:46,030 --> 00:04:50,610
Yes, even when you shot to the right corner, he tried to save with his right hand.

113
00:04:51,140 --> 00:04:54,340
They seem to have noticed Wakashimazu's injury.

114
00:04:54,340 --> 00:04:54,980
What?

115
00:04:54,980 --> 00:04:57,680
Toho managed to win and stay in the game until now thanks to Wakashimazu.

116
00:04:57,680 --> 00:05:00,310
Listen! Now we'll help with Wakashimazu's share of the defense!

117
00:05:00,310 --> 00:05:04,030
Listen! Now we'll help with Wakashimazu's share of the defense!

118
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:08,200
Now Toho's attack has begun!

119
00:05:08,200 --> 00:05:10,360
Alright! Go and get it, Toho!

120
00:05:12,660 --> 00:05:14,070
Hyuga-kun.

121
00:05:14,070 --> 00:05:14,910
Tsubasa.

122
00:05:15,460 --> 00:05:18,640
Despite your injuries, there's still life in your eyes.

123
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:21,300
As long as your eyes are like that, I cannot show mercy!

124
00:05:21,300 --> 00:05:23,170
I will fight you with all my strength!

125
00:05:24,810 --> 00:05:28,720
Tsubasa-kun reached for the ball by reflex, but he was sent flying!

126
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:29,470
Damn it!

127
00:05:30,220 --> 00:05:31,180
Sorimachi!

128
00:05:31,180 --> 00:05:31,680
Captain!

129
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:34,970
A beautiful one-two pass between Hyuga-kun and Sorimachi-kun.

130
00:05:34,970 --> 00:05:36,390
Hyuga is playing team football again!

131
00:05:37,440 --> 00:05:38,400
Alright!

132
00:05:39,590 --> 00:05:40,360
Stop it!

133
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,770
The Tiger Shot flies straight!

134
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,770
Tiger Shot

135
00:05:41,770 --> 00:05:45,150
It may be powerful, but if we get in front of it, we can stop it!

136
00:05:45,150 --> 00:05:51,720
The Tiger Shot I created just to defeat you, Nankatsu!

137
00:05:45,150 --> 00:05:51,720
Tiger Shot

138
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:52,910
Eat this!

139
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:58,420
Tiger Shot

140
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:58,420
Hyuga's Tiger Shot blew away the three defenders who bravely leaped in front of it!

141
00:05:59,500 --> 00:06:01,170
But he caught it!

142
00:06:01,170 --> 00:06:02,090
What?!

143
00:06:02,580 --> 00:06:07,490
Morisaki-kun dove and caught the weakened Tiger Shot with the blocking effect!

144
00:06:02,580 --> 00:06:07,490
Tiger Shot

145
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:05,060
Well done!

146
00:06:05,060 --> 00:06:06,590
That's why Nankatsu is the champion!

147
00:06:07,490 --> 00:06:09,090
Nice catch, Morisaki!

148
00:06:09,090 --> 00:06:12,350
