167
00:06:46,340 --> 00:06:49,800
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

168
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:53,180
Sawada-kun gets the ball!

169
00:06:53,180 --> 00:06:54,140
Tsubasa-kun.

170
00:07:00,300 --> 00:07:01,350
Tsubasa-san...

171
