193
00:07:49,570 --> 00:07:52,200
We know he's injured right now.

194
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:54,280
Nevertheless, we'll send the ball to you.

195
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:58,830
Toho strengthened their defense in front of the goal and stopped marking Tsubasa-kun!

196
00:07:58,830 --> 00:07:59,830
What?!

197
00:07:59,830 --> 00:08:00,710
No way!

198
00:08:00,710 --> 00:08:02,060
Time for the Drive Shot!

199
00:08:00,710 --> 00:08:02,060
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

200
00:08:02,060 --> 00:08:05,040
If I aim for the right corner now, I can definitely score!

201
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:07,840
Tsubasa gathers his preparation power for this shot!

202
00:08:08,420 --> 00:08:10,840
Can he paint the rainbow of victory?

203
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:12,620
Come if you want, Tsubasa!

204
00:08:12,620 --> 00:08:14,340
I'll stop you with only my right hand!

205
00:08:16,150 --> 00:08:18,490
Tiger Shot!

206
00:08:16,150 --> 00:08:18,490
Tiger Shot

207
00:08:18,490 --> 00:08:20,680
It blows like a side wind!

208
00:08:22,730 --> 00:08:25,060
He clears the ball before being hit!

209
00:08:25,060 --> 00:08:28,820
Hyuga-kun defeated the Drive Shot with the Tiger Shot!

210
00:08:25,060 --> 00:08:28,820
Tiger Shot
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

211
00:08:28,820 --> 00:08:31,820
No matter what, I won't concede a fourth goal!

212
00:08:33,330 --> 00:08:34,530
Hyuga-kun...

213
00:08:34,530 --> 00:08:37,840
The stadium fell silent at the spectacle of this great battle!

214
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:41,410
13 minutes remain in this crucial final match!

215
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:49,440
~Anime Lovers~
