We won't lose!

218
00:08:54,170 --> 00:08:56,260
Yes, we can't lose!

219
00:08:56,260 --> 00:08:57,100
Here!

220
00:08:59,390 --> 00:09:00,990
Time for a counter-attack!

221
00:09:00,990 --> 00:09:02,930
Yes, we can't lose!

222
00:09:02,930 --> 00:09:07,230
Did Hyuga-kun's play inspire the fighting spirit of tigers?

223
00:09:09,620 --> 00:09:11,850
The ball successfully reached Sorimachi-kun!

224
00:09:11,850 --> 00:09:13,920
He has a chance to shoot!

225
00:09:13,920 --> 00:09:16,240
However, Sorimachi-kun doesn't shoot!

226
00:09:16,240 --> 00:09:18,120
Please shoot, Captain!

227
00:09:19,490 --> 00:09:23,250
He's right! That's why you returned to the field, captain!

228
00:09:23,250 --> 00:09:25,950
Scoring the final winning goal that leads Toho Academy to victory

229
00:09:25,950 --> 00:09:28,590
