230
00:09:28,590 --> 00:09:29,790
Everyone...

231
00:09:30,630 --> 00:09:33,880
The ball goes to the unmarked Hyuga-kun in front of the goal!

232
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:35,510
Go on, Kojiro!

233
00:09:36,010 --> 00:09:37,770
I'll score, everyone!

234
00:09:37,770 --> 00:09:40,350
Hyuga-kun's Tiger Shot!

235
00:09:37,770 --> 00:09:40,350
Tiger Shot

236
00:09:41,010 --> 00:09:42,270
Alright, we did it!

237
00:09:44,520 --> 00:09:45,320
I'll stop it.

238
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:47,310
I'm the only one who can stop this!

239
00:09:47,310 --> 00:09:48,230
So reckless!

240
00:09:48,230 --> 00:09:51,150
If he takes Hyuga's Tiger Shot from this proximity,

241
00:09:48,230 --> 00:09:51,150
Tiger Shot

242
00:09:51,150 --> 00:09:54,610
