247
00:10:02,630 --> 00:10:04,750
Hyuga-kun doesn't shoot!

248
00:10:04,750 --> 00:10:07,950
Tsubasa, this isn't an act of mercy!

249
00:10:07,950 --> 00:10:11,450
The only reason I stopped was to ensure that everyone's pass

250
00:10:11,450 --> 00:10:14,710
