263
00:10:42,290 --> 00:10:43,490
Ishizaki-kun...

264
00:10:46,220 --> 00:10:48,410
If you hadn't jumped in front of him,

265
00:10:48,410 --> 00:10:50,000
there's no way I could have blocked it.

266
00:10:50,920 --> 00:10:54,930
This is also a combination play between you and me, Tsubasa.

267
00:10:54,930 --> 00:10:55,960
Ishizaki-kun...

268
00:10:55,960 --> 00:10:58,860
You lost the Golden Duo with Misaki,

269
00:10:58,860 --> 00:11:01,830
but we can call this the duo of gold and pebble.

270
00:11:01,830 --> 00:11:03,700
That's not right, Ishizaki.

271
00:11:03,700 --> 00:11:04,350
Huh?

272
00:11:04,350 --> 00:11:07,630
That play was the best golden duo Nankatsu has.

273
00:11:07,630 --> 00:11:11,130
When it's Tsubasa and Ishizaki, we should call it the Unruly Duo.

274
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:14,910
Alright, let's block the corner kick too.

275
00:11:14,910 --> 00:11:17,200
Let's go together as Nankatsu this time!

276
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:17,860
Okay!

277
00:11:18,330 --> 00:11:19,420
Everyone...

278
00:11:20,860 --> 00:11:22,350
Can you get up?

279
00:11:22,350 --> 00:11:23,220
Yes.

280
00:11:25,700 --> 00:11:28,120
Thank you, Ishizaki-kun.

281
00:11:28,760 --> 00:11:34,130
You were the first friend I made when I moved to Nankatsu city, Ishizaki-kun.

282
00:11:34,920 --> 00:11:38,320
One of the reasons I rejected the offer from Toho talent scouts

283
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:41,880
was that you, Ishizaki-kun, were staying at Nankatsu.

284
00:11:42,540 --> 00:11:45,560
The match will continue with Toho's corner kick,

285
00:11:45,560 --> 00:11:48,560
but Hyuga-kun is completely marked.

286
00:11:48,560 --> 00:11:49,850
Imai-san!

287
00:11:49,850 --> 00:11:51,560
Give it to me!

288
00:11:51,560 --> 00:11:52,760
Alright.

289
00:11:53,520 --> 00:11:55,910
The ball goes to Sawada-kun!

290
00:11:55,910 --> 00:11:57,420
It was a short corner kick.

291
00:11:57,420 --> 00:11:58,230
Here!

292
00:11:58,820 --> 00:11:59,610
What?!

293
00:12:00,780 --> 00:12:01,450
This...

294
00:12:01,450 --> 00:12:03,950
Goalkeeper Wakashimazu-kun is coming!

295
00:12:04,160 --> 00:12:07,280
Even if I can't use my left arm, I can still shoot!

296
00:12:07,280 --> 00:12:11,000
I'll do it because I let everyone be burdened with defense.

297
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:12,790
Take this, Nankatsu!

298
00:12:13,540 --> 00:12:14,630
Damn it!

299
00:12:15,170 --> 00:12:17,500
Takasugi-kun blocked it!

300
00:12:18,920 --> 00:12:21,300
The ball rises in front of the goal!

301
00:12:21,300 --> 00:12:22,630
Why is it always me...?

302
00:12:22,630 --> 00:12:24,180
Good, it's mine!

303
00:12:24,180 --> 00:12:25,140
Leave it to me!

304
00:12:25,570 --> 00:12:27,930
Izawa-kun won the battle!

305
00:12:30,070 --> 00:12:32,080
Tsubasa-kun clears the ball and relieves his team.

306
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:33,560
Nankatsu escapes the crisis!

307
00:12:33,560 --> 00:12:35,770
Great job despite your battered body.

308
00:12:36,640 --> 00:12:37,440
This!

309
00:12:38,450 --> 00:12:40,210
He didn't clear the ball.

310
00:12:40,210 --> 00:12:41,190
He took a shot.

311
00:12:41,190 --> 00:12:42,570
Damn it!

312
00:12:42,570 --> 00:12:46,320
Since their goalkeeper Wakashimazu-kun started joining the attack,

313
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:48,330
Toho's goal was left completely open!

314
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:53,710
The ball is bouncing towards the goal!

315
00:12:54,130 --> 00:12:56,580
I won't let anyone score on me!

316
00:13:05,060 --> 00:13:06,340
Here!

317
00:13:07,580 --> 00:13:10,490
If Tsubasa had been in his usual condition,

318
00:13:10,490 --> 00:13:11,850
there's no way I would have caught up.

319
00:13:14,810 --> 00:13:17,800
Damn it, it's impossible to get the ball to Hyuga-san like this.

320
00:13:17,800 --> 00:13:19,400
Don't mind me!

321
00:13:19,400 --> 00:13:21,460
The more they mark me,

322
00:13:21,460 --> 00:13:24,090
the more space they give you!

323
00:13:24,090 --> 00:13:26,040
I don't have to take the last goal!

324
00:13:26,040 --> 00:13:28,410
Just think about winning, nothing else!

325
00:13:28,410 --> 00:13:29,970
Hyuga-san.

326
00:13:29,970 --> 00:13:30,660
Alright!

327
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:32,160
I'm going!

328
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:35,960
Tsubasa-kun...

329
00:13:35,960 --> 00:13:37,210
Tsubasa-kun.

330
00:13:37,210 --> 00:13:38,830
What's wrong, Misugi?

331
00:13:38,830 --> 00:13:41,500
Tsubasa hasn't moved a single step for a while.

332
00:13:42,630 --> 00:13:44,010
This isn't good.

333
00:13:44,010 --> 00:13:46,460
I can barely stand.

334
00:13:46,460 --> 00:13:47,930
My body...

335
00:13:47,930 --> 00:13:50,100
Won't move.

336
00:13:50,100 --> 00:13:52,680
Sorry. I'm sorry, everyone.

337
00:13:52,680 --> 00:13:53,970
Coach!

338
00:13:54,870 --> 00:13:56,690
Doctor Kamijo!

339
00:13:56,690 --> 00:14:00,020
Is Nankatsu preparing for a substitution in the final moments?

340
00:14:01,020 --> 00:14:03,980
Are they going to replace their captain Tsubasa-kun?

341
00:14:04,650 --> 00:14:05,950
What did you say?

342
00:14:05,950 --> 00:14:07,530
You're saying I'll be substituted for Tsubasa?

343
00:14:08,230 --> 00:14:10,000
Number 10...

344
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:11,280
I've been replaced...

345
00:14:11,980 --> 00:14:15,910
Tsubasa, 10 is the number of aces in Brazil.

346
00:14:15,910 --> 00:14:18,330
It's a number everyone strives to be.

347
00:14:19,490 --> 00:14:21,300
Roberto...

348
00:14:21,300 --> 00:14:22,940
But nothing can be done.

349
00:14:22,940 --> 00:14:26,300
I mean, my body won't move.

350
00:14:26,730 --> 00:14:27,800
A chance!

351
00:14:27,800 --> 00:14:31,110
Taking advantage of a moment's distraction, he passes the ball to Hyuga-kun!

352
00:14:31,110 --> 00:14:32,470
D-Damn it!

353
00:14:33,420 --> 00:14:35,060
3 minutes left!

354
00:14:35,060 --> 00:14:38,860
For Toho's first championship, Hyuga-kun

355
00:14:38,860 --> 00:14:42,570
is about to fire the Tiger Shot for victory!

356
00:14:38,860 --> 00:14:42,570
Tiger Shot

357
00:14:42,570 --> 00:14:45,190
Hyuga-kun will shoot.

358
00:14:45,190 --> 00:14:47,830
No, I can't move.

359
00:14:47,830 --> 00:14:51,120
I can't go there and stop it anymore.

360
00:14:51,710 --> 00:14:52,840
I'm going to lose.

361
00:14:53,740 --> 00:14:55,120
Am I going to lose?

362
00:14:56,290 --> 00:14:57,870
Still, it'll end with this.

363
00:14:58,480 --> 00:15:00,620
I can finally be at ease.

364
00:15:00,620 --> 00:15:03,510
I'm sure everyone will understand.

365
00:15:03,510 --> 00:15:05,730
I did my best.

366
00:15:05,730 --> 00:15:08,390
Even if I don't win the 3rd championship...

367
00:15:08,390 --> 00:15:11,090
I have other dreams to achieve.

368
00:15:11,090 --> 00:15:13,440
I'll go to Brazil and become a professional.

369
00:15:13,440 --> 00:15:16,040
Then I'll make Japan number one in the world.

370
00:15:16,040 --> 00:15:18,930
Compared to that, this tournament is so...

371
00:15:20,440 --> 00:15:24,840
But... Then why have I fought until now,

372
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:26,360
abusing my body like this...?

373
00:15:29,610 --> 00:15:30,950
Tsubasa!

374
00:15:32,950 --> 00:15:35,430
Is it really good for you?!

375
00:15:35,430 --> 00:15:37,700
Is now the time for your fuel to run out, Tsubasa?!

376
00:15:38,150 --> 00:15:39,330
Hyuga-kun...

377
00:15:40,660 --> 00:15:42,250
Eat this!

378
00:15:43,470 --> 00:15:45,090
Tsubasa, watch out!

379
00:15:45,090 --> 00:15:45,750
Run!

380
00:15:50,910 --> 00:15:54,090
Despite that, Tsubasa-kun didn't fall!

381
00:15:55,140 --> 00:15:58,460
Tsubasa, if it's truly over for you,

382
00:15:58,460 --> 00:16:01,770
I'll personally hammer the nails into your coffin!

383
00:16:01,770 --> 00:16:02,770
Eat this!

384
00:16:03,630 --> 00:16:04,530
What?!

385
00:16:04,530 --> 00:16:07,110
He dodges with an instantaneous fast jump!

386
00:16:07,110 --> 00:16:08,360
Tsubasa-kun is in the air!

387
00:16:10,190 --> 00:16:12,200
Tsubasa has revived.

388
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:13,700
Impossible!

389
00:16:13,700 --> 00:16:15,700
Another miracle has occurred.

390
00:16:16,110 --> 00:16:19,670
Even though he took a direct Tiger Shot, it's as if Tsubasa-kun has resurrected!

391
00:16:16,110 --> 00:16:19,670
Tiger Shot

392
00:16:19,670 --> 00:16:21,210
He's truly a phoenix!

393
00:16:21,210 --> 00:16:23,470
Great, follow Tsubasa's lead!

394
00:16:23,470 --> 00:16:24,290
Okay!

395
00:16:25,250 --> 00:16:28,620
Tsubasa, run until your strength dries up,

396
00:16:28,620 --> 00:16:31,450
towards your dream, with all the power inside you,

397
00:16:31,450 --> 00:16:35,390
run until you reach your body's limit!

398
00:16:35,390 --> 00:16:36,950
Run, Tsubasa!

399
00:16:36,950 --> 00:16:38,600
Tsubasa, run!

400
00:16:38,600 --> 00:16:41,350
Tsubasa isn't dead yet.

401
00:16:41,350 --> 00:16:43,770
This is our final battle, Tsubasa!

402
00:16:51,830 --> 00:16:53,240
Tsubasa senpai!

403
00:16:56,290 --> 00:16:58,620
Tsubasa-kun is preparing to shoot!

404
00:16:58,620 --> 00:17:01,120
But Hyuga-kun manages to circle around him!

405
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:02,960
I won't let you score!

406
00:17:02,960 --> 00:17:05,370
A one-on-one battle between Tsubasa-kun and Hyuga-kun.

407
00:17:05,370 --> 00:17:08,960
Should I miss the timing and send it back with a Drive Shot?

408
00:17:05,370 --> 00:17:08,960
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

409
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:12,590
I won't call it a victory until I win against you!

410
00:17:12,590 --> 00:17:13,640
He's right.

411
00:17:13,640 --> 00:17:16,390
If I run now, it's not a true victory!

412
00:17:17,790 --> 00:17:19,700
They strike the ball at the same time!

413
00:17:19,700 --> 00:17:21,680
A battle between equal forces!

414
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:23,490
Tsubasa!

415
00:17:23,490 --> 00:17:24,180
Hyuga-san!

416
00:17:24,180 --> 00:17:26,650
The ball didn't move an inch!

417
00:17:30,860 --> 00:17:35,450
Go, carry our dreams and paint the rainbow of victory!

418
00:17:36,450 --> 00:17:39,160
Drive Shot!

419
00:17:36,450 --> 00:17:43,200
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

420
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:43,200
Tsubasa-kun's Drive Shot flies into the deep blue sky!

421
00:17:44,140 --> 00:17:45,350
Will I lose...

422
00:17:46,230 --> 00:17:48,290
Will I lose again?!

423
00:17:49,530 --> 00:17:50,500
I'll stop it.

424
00:17:50,500 --> 00:17:52,130
I definitely will!

425
00:17:53,960 --> 00:17:56,010
Karate Strike Defense!

426
00:17:58,430 --> 00:18:00,310
He blocked it!

427
00:18:00,310 --> 00:18:03,770
Wakashimazu-kun clears the Drive Shot, preventing it from spinning!

428
00:18:00,310 --> 00:18:03,770
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

429
00:18:08,620 --> 00:18:09,520
Wakashimazu!

430
00:18:10,970 --> 00:18:12,970
He caught up to me…

431
00:18:12,970 --> 00:18:15,610
Well done, Wakashimazu-kun…

432
00:18:16,400 --> 00:18:17,380
Clear the ball!

433
00:18:17,380 --> 00:18:18,740
Keep attacking!

434
00:18:19,410 --> 00:18:20,910
Toho clears it!

435
00:18:21,450 --> 00:18:23,950
The ball came back to Tsubasa!

436
00:18:24,670 --> 00:18:25,780
The ball...

437
00:18:25,780 --> 00:18:28,420
My friend is coming back to me!

438
00:18:28,420 --> 00:18:30,150
I must shoot!

439
00:18:30,150 --> 00:18:31,370
Tsubasa-kun!

440
00:18:32,170 --> 00:18:33,500
I'm going to shoot!

441
00:18:34,340 --> 00:18:37,260
Tsubasa-kun will unleash his Drive Shot!

442
00:18:34,340 --> 00:18:37,260
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

443
00:18:40,290 --> 00:18:41,260
Damn it!

444
00:18:41,260 --> 00:18:45,270
With the help of the Drive Shot, I'll score from here!

445
00:18:41,260 --> 00:18:45,270
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

446
00:18:45,980 --> 00:18:49,100
Tiger Shot!

447
00:18:45,980 --> 00:18:49,100
Tiger Shot

448
00:18:49,100 --> 00:18:51,260
Hyuga-kun sent his shot back!

449
00:18:51,260 --> 00:18:52,360
Go!

450
00:18:52,360 --> 00:18:53,820
This is definitely a chance!

451
00:18:53,820 --> 00:18:55,040
He's aiming for a goal!

452
00:18:55,040 --> 00:18:58,320
Madness! The opponent's goal is almost 90 meters away!

453
00:18:59,490 --> 00:19:00,860
T-This...!

454
00:19:00,860 --> 00:19:04,870
Here's the final shot!

455
00:19:04,870 --> 00:19:08,580
Tsubasa-kun returned the ball with his Bouncing Shot!

456
00:19:08,580 --> 00:19:09,540
What?!

457
00:19:09,540 --> 00:19:13,040
The repelled Tiger Shot and Drive Shot's

458
00:19:09,540 --> 00:19:13,040
Tiger Shot
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

459
00:19:13,040 --> 00:19:16,550
rainbow heads directly towards Toho's goal!

460
00:19:22,110 --> 00:19:22,800
Ken!

461
00:19:24,810 --> 00:19:25,930
I scored a goal!

462
00:19:25,930 --> 00:19:27,160
I must stop it!

463
00:19:27,160 --> 00:19:31,770
I refuse to lose to Tsubasa and Nankatsu!

464
00:19:32,790 --> 00:19:33,800
Hyuga!

465
00:19:33,800 --> 00:19:34,980
He stopped it!

466
00:19:34,980 --> 00:19:36,400
Another save!

467
00:19:36,400 --> 00:19:37,400
Kojiro!

468
00:19:37,400 --> 00:19:38,570
Captain!

469
00:19:38,570 --> 00:19:39,530
Hyuga-san!

470
00:19:39,530 --> 00:19:41,280
Wakashimazu-san!

471
00:19:42,050 --> 00:19:44,830
Wakashimazu-kun stood near the line!

472
00:19:44,830 --> 00:19:47,330
Nankatsu failed!

473
00:19:48,250 --> 00:19:49,900
So strong!

474
00:19:49,900 --> 00:19:51,860
As expected of you, Hyuga-kun...

475
00:19:52,750 --> 00:19:55,460
The whistle marking the end of the second half blows!

476
00:19:55,460 --> 00:19:57,460
Neither side could reach a conclusion!

477
00:19:57,460 --> 00:19:59,970
The match will continue with extra time.

478
00:19:59,970 --> 00:20:01,220
Tsubasa!

479
00:20:01,220 --> 00:20:02,420
Tsubasa!

480
00:20:02,420 --> 00:20:03,880
What's wrong, Tsubasa?!

481
00:20:03,880 --> 00:20:05,220
Are you okay?

482
00:20:06,430 --> 00:20:10,060
Now, everyone, it's extra time.

483
00:20:11,230 --> 00:20:12,530
Tsubasa!

484
00:20:12,530 --> 00:20:16,400
Unfortunately, I can't let you play.

485
00:20:16,400 --> 00:20:18,600
As the doctor said.

486
00:20:18,600 --> 00:20:21,240
You've really done a great job up until now.

487
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:25,660
Leave the rest to the others and focus on treating your leg and shoulder.

488
00:20:25,660 --> 00:20:28,910
Doctor, I didn't faint.

489
00:20:29,780 --> 00:20:34,380
The moment I thought my strength was gone, Hyuga-kun woke me up.

490
00:20:34,380 --> 00:20:38,960
My body hadn't reached its limit then.

491
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:44,510
For the sake of Hyuga-kun, who made me realize this, I must fight.

492
00:20:44,510 --> 00:20:45,780
He's right!

493
00:20:45,780 --> 00:20:47,980
Do you think a player who can't play could make shots

494
00:20:47,980 --> 00:20:50,210
like those one after another?

495
00:20:50,210 --> 00:20:54,210
You should have taken Tsubasa out of the game when he couldn't move.

496
00:20:54,210 --> 00:20:55,020
You...

497
00:20:55,480 --> 00:20:59,700
Let's aim for our dreamed 3rd championship until the very end!

498
00:20:59,700 --> 00:21:00,530
Yes..

499
00:21:09,450 --> 00:21:11,000
Manager...

500
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:12,290
Tsubasa-kun.

501
00:21:14,960 --> 00:21:17,510
Tsubasa-kun, even after this,

502
00:21:17,510 --> 00:21:20,050
do your best in the extra time.

503
00:21:24,300 --> 00:21:25,050
Here.

504
00:21:26,800 --> 00:21:28,340
Thank you.

505
00:21:38,250 --> 00:21:39,480
Ah?

506
00:21:41,220 --> 00:21:43,250
What's wrong, Kumi-chan?

507
00:21:43,250 --> 00:21:46,860
I don't know why, but... My tears started flowing.

508
00:21:46,860 --> 00:21:49,390
You didn't score even once in the second half, huh?

509
00:21:49,390 --> 00:21:51,600
Still, it's been a good game so far.

510
00:21:51,600 --> 00:21:54,370
You guys really defended well in the end!

511
00:21:54,370 --> 00:21:57,810
Wakashimazu, I'll trust you in the extra time too.

512
00:21:57,810 --> 00:21:59,130
Yes, please trust me!

513
00:21:59,130 --> 00:22:02,110
The 20-minute extra time will be a decisive battle!

514
00:22:02,110 --> 00:22:03,090
Yes!

515
00:22:03,090 --> 00:22:05,790
Extra time consisting of two 10-minute halves

516
00:22:04,340 --> 00:22:06,090
EXTRA TIME

517
00:22:05,790 --> 00:22:08,430
will begin in front of the large audience!

518
00:22:09,310 --> 00:22:12,620
Extra time will start with Nankatsu's kickoff!

519
00:22:19,460 --> 00:22:34,460
~Anime Lovers~
You can share your thoughts about this episode under our Instagram posts...

