chô-chô samba, zigzag samba

525
00:22:50,210 --> 00:22:56,260
Butterfly samba zig-zag samba

526
00:22:56,260 --> 00:23:00,890
aitsu no uwasa de chamba mo hashiru

527
00:22:56,260 --> 00:23:00,890
Even little old ladies are talking about him.

528
